# TUI clip: unlock, List > Integrations, open notion, Credentials tab.
# Needs a LOCKED admin session (record.sh logs out first): the root menu
# opens on Login, Enter opens it, then the passphrase.
Output dop-tui-light.mp4
Output dop-tui-light.gif
Source common.tape
Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show
Sleep 600ms
Type "dop"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 1800ms
Enter
Sleep 900ms
Type "pass-word-long-enough"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2200ms
Type "3"
Sleep 1400ms
Enter
Sleep 2400ms
Down
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 2600ms
Tab
Sleep 2800ms
